        <UserObject label="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;___1et8vw6 f18zxyen f1mevb6&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(214, 214, 214);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;VNet Link — what it does&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;___yduxjt0 fjh19gf f18zxyen f1mevb6 f1mswpri&quot; style=&quot;padding-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 12px; list-style-type: revert; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(214, 214, 214);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Joins a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Private DNS Zone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;VNet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;so Azure DNS (168.63.129.16) consults the zone for lookups&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Without the link → hostnames resolve to the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;public IP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;→ service rejects with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;___j8udjr0 f1ctqxl6 f1jl2yie fq9zq91 f19n0e5 f7w2ec9 fg9hu40 fywfov9 fruq291 f7x41pl fclwglc&quot; style=&quot;border-color: rgb(82, 82, 82); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: rgb(10, 10, 10); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;403&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;It is a separate Azure resource that lives&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;on the zone&lt;/strong&gt;, not on the VNet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;___1et8vw6 f18zxyen f1mevb6&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(214, 214, 214);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600; background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Cardinality&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;___yduxjt0 fjh19gf f18zxyen f1mevb6 f1mswpri&quot; style=&quot;padding-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 12px; list-style-type: revert; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(214, 214, 214);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;One zone per PaaS service type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(e.g. one&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;___j8udjr0 f1ctqxl6 f1jl2yie fq9zq91 f19n0e5 f7w2ec9 fg9hu40 fywfov9 fruq291 f7x41pl fclwglc&quot; style=&quot;border-color: rgb(82, 82, 82); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-image: none 100% / 1 / 0 stretch; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; background-color: rgb(10, 10, 10); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;privatelink.vaultcore.azure.net&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;___11wyd0v f1j4dglz&quot; style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;all&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Key Vaults)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;One VNet Link per (zone, VNet)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;pair — not per Private Endpoint&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;One A-record per Private Endpoint&lt;/strong&gt;, inside the zone&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;___ka489f0 f8l5zjj&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(153, 255, 153)); font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;A VNet links to&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;many&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;zones (one per service type); a zone links to&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;___1cb78qm fl43uef&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;many&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;VNets&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" id="0gJtCKeqW_H3lINbthzb-3">
